rom 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle, October to November came in at 33% of normal and November to December at 45%. So far in 2026 on the middle, January to February sits at 37% of normal and June to July at 53%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, with grid 23501 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
